{"id":"memoria","lemma":"memoria","pos":"noun","rank":962,"glosses":["memory (the ability of the brain to record information)","memory (a specific thing that is remembered)","report, document"],"ipa":"/meˈmoɾja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"memorias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-memoria.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él perdió la memoria.","en":"He lost his memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65175"},{"text":"Él tiene buena memoria.","en":"He has a good memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453724"},{"text":"Me lo sé de memoria.","en":"I know it by heart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450010"},{"text":"Me lo aprendí de memoria.","en":"I learned it by heart.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454242"},{"text":"Me gustaría tener mejor memoria.","en":"I wish I had a better memory.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553578"}]}